The StorageController tool is returning an error message because the commands being sent to it are not in the correct format. The error message indicates that the list indices must be integers or slices, not strings.

To resolve this issue, I will reformat the commands to ensure that they are in the correct format. I will then resubmit the commands to the StorageController tool.

First, I will use the AnalyticsTool to get the list of videos stored in the Amsterdam cache node.

```json
{
  "type": "function",
  "name": "AnalyticsTool",
  "parameters": {}
}
```

After getting the list of videos, I will reformat the commands to delete these videos from the Amsterdam cache node.

Then, I will use the StorageController tool to delete the videos.

```json
{
  "type": "function",
  "name": "StorageController",
  "parameters": {
    "commands": "[{\"cmd\": \"DELETE\", \"destination\": \"AMSTERDAM_CACHE\", \"date_time\": \"2024-09-16T14:30:00\", \"content_id\": \"video1\"}, {\"cmd\": \"DELETE\", \"destination\": \"AMSTERDAM_CACHE\", \"date_time\": \"2024-09-16T14:30:00\", \"content_id\": \"video2\"}, {\"cmd\": \"DELETE\", \"destination\": \"AMSTERDAM_CACHE\", \"date_time\": \"2024-09-16T14:30:00\", \"content_id\": \"video4\"}, {\"cmd\": \"DELETE\", \"destination\": \"AMSTERDAM_CACHE\", \"date_time\": \"2024-09-16T14:30:00\", \"content_id\": \"video8\"}, {\"cmd\": \"DELETE\", \"destination\": \"AMSTERDAM_CACHE\", \"date_time\": \"2024-09-16T14:30:00\", \"content_id\": \"video9\"}, {\"cmd\": \"DELETE\", \"destination\": \"AMSTERDAM_CACHE\", \"date_time\": \"2024-09-16T14:30:00\", \"content_id\": \"video10\"}, {\"cmd\": \"DELETE\", \"destination\": \"AMSTERDAM_CACHE\", \"date_time\": \"2024-09-16T14:30:00\", \"content_id\": \"video12\"}, {\"cmd\": \"DELETE\", \"destination\": \"AMSTERDAM_CACHE\", \"date_time\": \"2024-09-16T14:30:00\", \"content_id\": \"video13\"}, {\"cmd\": \"DELETE\", \"destination\": \"AMSTERDAM_CACHE\", \"date_time\": \"2024-09-16T14:30:00\", \"content_id\": \"video16\"}]"
  }
}
```

